{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0313_1000_p", "source_sha256": "31693eed7b61479f5606dced59f54e25376738cf584ff11377778f884836401f", "ja": "（『夜想令嬢』のイベントは、好評で終わった。\nあれ以来、事務所にも感想が多く届いている）", "zh": "（《夜想令嬢》的活动在一片好评中落下帷幕。自那以后，事务所也收到了许多观后感。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0313_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "af20ec5b87a236d6f3f4809f4b6b882d40981bc73677cbc54158bdcb553b6f8a", "ja": "ふんふふふーん♪　\nあっ、{$P$}、お疲れ～。", "zh": "哼哼哼——♪  \n啊，{$P$}，辛苦啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0313_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3eb1c52c2893e4d87df6f829e9eda03f8f150145b230cd5f43f6218db809e73b", "ja": "恵美か、お疲れさま。ちょうど良かった、\nファンの人達からイベントの感想の手紙が届いてるよ。", "zh": "是惠美啊，辛苦了。正好，粉丝们寄来了对活动感想的信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0313_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "59b1f202c7b345b2bf8b3a92ba48c954591b73c83b6d937242512cb5e0c4c84f", "ja": "感想の手紙！？　見たい見たーい！\nねね、どんな感じだった？", "zh": "感想信吗！？想看看——！\n呐呐，大家都说了些什么呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0313_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "df01df930f45748bc73787645d89a91509a779418874dc435b52091aeb8de256", "ja": "ブログのコメントとかは、いいカンジだったよね。\nアタシ的にも、かなりがんばったと思うんだけど……。", "zh": "博客上的评论什么的，反响都挺不错的。\n我也觉得自己已经相当努力了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0313_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b126c8e407535624948182ff9c94d09dec0e2c53aa4d9447f63a04bd100992a8", "ja": "好評だよ。番外編とか特に、\n幸せそうで良かったって。", "zh": "评价很好哦。特别是番外篇，\n大家都在说看起来很幸福真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0313_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "67e05219e5804dc597e9dc5209913a1a4881d4baffd994d2dfea0d1453edf0f4", "ja": "そっかそっか、それなら良かったよ。\nあとで朋花たちとみんなで見るね。ありがと！", "zh": "这样啊这样啊，那就太好了。\n之后我会和朋花她们一起看看的。谢谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0313_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "23fef70af27ea0491a0d578af922f531046bb52dd66312a118fd0b65281d9129", "ja": "『夜想令嬢』でまた仕事できて、楽しかったよ。\n{$P$}には感謝だね！", "zh": "能再次和『夜想令嬢』一起工作，真的很开心。\n得好好感谢{$P$}呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0313_1008_p", "source_sha256": "66dd8b192bb5a61c1584c452e55ea39f6ff9159628028077e01f1fbaae10cbe0", "ja": "そうなのか？　『夜想令嬢』での活動自体は、\n今までにも結構あったと思うけど。", "zh": "是吗？不过，我觉得之前也有过不少以『夜想令嬢』开展的活动吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0313_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "4401ecad8787b032a5976d095f84145596903e353d75679d3065db3d34c0e594", "ja": "それはそうなんだけどね～。\nやっぱ、お芝居をするのはちょっと違うっていうか。", "zh": "虽然是这样没错啦～但果然，演戏的时候还是有点不一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0313_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "a367870f01a70caf1ee08baf6609798bda8965bd17f1b8a42d160256001731a5", "ja": "お芝居してる間はアタシとか朋花じゃなくて、\nエドガーとクリスになってるから……。", "zh": "演戏的时候，就不是我和朋花了，而是变成了埃德加和克里斯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0313_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "d8c5acc075b7e10dea21bf95d879b50d940290401da1ed11564790b8f343875e", "ja": "なんか、久しぶりに友達に会ったって感じ？\nみたいな……にゃはは、アタシ説明下手くそだね！", "zh": "总觉得像是久违地见到了朋友？大概是这种感觉吧……呀哈哈，我还真不擅长解释呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0313_1012_p", "source_sha256": "beff30d65fc1d854f666d3c9fcfc99f58551c78b2f5b328e181618c278211786", "ja": "いや……そうか。恵美にとってエドガーは、\nもう役柄を超えて、自分の一部みたいなものなんだな。", "zh": "不……这样啊。对惠美来说，埃德加已经超越了角色本身，成了自己的一部分啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0313_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "856df519abb0c897d9b8c1cd15768ab4c9df77e7428adc7b7b71f3aa268b9bb3", "ja": "あ、そういうコト？\n……うん、そうかも！", "zh": "啊，是这么回事？\n……嗯，也许吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0313_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "4b6ede924b26c22f03257ef9baf2418b1593a072eace758726350e63a2d32626", "ja": "さすが{$P$}だね！\nなんかアタシのコト、何でもわかってるみたい。", "zh": "不愧是{$P$}！\n感觉你就像什么都了解我一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0313_1015_p", "source_sha256": "78f68e208980f7266913ecce1dc9c11480a84eebe1b747ed60af2db285bda7ea", "ja": "何でもはわからないけど……\n今、恵美に必要なものなら当てられるかもしれないな。", "zh": "虽然我不是什么都知道……但要是现在惠美需要什么，说不定我能猜到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0313_1016_020meg", "source_sha256": "71dd2479fc2c67d19655df3e7d2d825a511922e18a0bccbd1a8e31361babd2d1", "ja": "えっ、今のアタシに必要なもの？\nなになに？", "zh": "诶，现在的我需要的东西？\n是什么是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0313_1017", "source_sha256": "7c1cff7b4505d35932e16a6098c669f1f67c9d4a21b513797f04617584ee9e8e", "ja": "ファミレスのドリンクバー！", "zh": "家庭餐厅的饮料吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0313_2000_p", "source_sha256": "97496a80bfe718d70b698bf3e94cb9584f8c69bcf1b50efd44cda5088d1a11fc", "ja": "感想の手紙を読むのに、\nファミレスのドリンクバー、かな！", "zh": "要不要去家庭餐厅的饮料吧读读感想信，怎么样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0313_2001_020meg", "source_sha256": "4293570e5b49ee7f7766c824975aa7a6e8892dc5e3210af7d7ad35e6c50da552", "ja": "あははっ、なにそれ～！\nもー、{$P$}ってば。", "zh": "啊哈哈，什么嘛～！\n真是的，{$P$}你呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0313_2002_020meg", "source_sha256": "fd13e237fb00d2767d7552801720687a016e2ec9bd15659fa8dc4173f9c092ec", "ja": "うんうん、たしかにそのとおり！　んじゃアタシ、\n着替えてくるから、みんな誘ってファミレス行こっ♪", "zh": "嗯嗯，确实是这样！那我先去\n换衣服了，之后去叫上大家一起去家庭餐厅吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
